If They Decline the Info Pack
Ask gently:
“Of course. Is it more about timing, or are you still comparing other
opportunities?”
Then respond according to their concern:
• Timing: “Totally fine — I can update you when new slots open.”
• ROI/trust: “Everything is audited annually and managed by an
international operator.”
• Comparing options: “I can share how Aria Vista differs from a typical
villa investment.”
• Uncertain: “Would you like a quick summary of how the returns are
structured?”
• Not interested: “Thank you for your time — I’ll make a note not to
follow up.”
